<title>ARGENTINA: South American weekly vegoil, subproduct prices.</title>
<headline>South American weekly vegoil, subproduct prices.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South American vegoil and subproduct export offer/bid prices at close December 20 as quoted by the J.J. Hinrichsen brokerage (in U.S. dollars per tonne, or basis nearby CBOT contract).</p>
<p>ARGENTINA, FOB Argentine ports</p>
<p>Peanutoil  Jan 810/795</p>
<p> Soy oil    Jan 511/508 May/Jul -100/-125</p>
<p> Sunoil     Jan 517/510 Mar 510/506</p>
<p> Linsd oil  n/a</p>
<p> Ctnsd oil  n/a</p>
<p>Soy plts  Jan +2/+1 Feb +4/+1 May/Sep +27/+28  Sunplts   Jan/Feb 135/130 Jan/Mar 135/130</p>
<p>	     Apr/Jun 115/110</p>
<p>Ctn plts  unq Lin expl  unq</p>
<p>Brazil, FOB Paranagua Soy plts Jan +30/+27 Feb +19/+15 Mar +0/-3 May/Jul -16/-16.5</p>
<p>	    May/Sep -15/-15.5</p>
<p>Parana-Rotterdam freight was steady from last week at $22 a tonne FISTLO.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
